window.ME_DATA = {"generatedAt":"2026-10-24T20:45:39.479Z","version":"0.16.0","total":897,"recent":183,"tags":1987,"byKind":{"project":357,"knowledge":205,"mistake":165,"content":111,"tool":44,"prompt":12,"business":3},"quarantine":{"pending":5,"rejected":2,"deleted":1,"total":8},"approved":[{"path":"02-Projects/northstar-cursor-pagination.md","kind":"project","title":"northstar API 分页从 offset 改为 cursor","tags":["northstar","api","pagination","sqlite"],"summary":"# northstar API 分页从 offset 改为 cursor\n\n## 决策\n\n把 `/api/items` 的分页从 `offset/limit` 改为 `cursor`：offset 在深度翻页时会因为并发写入重复或漏项。 - cursor 使用 `(updated_at, id)` 复合键，排序稳定。 - 兼容期保留 `offset`，响应头返回 `next_cursor`，2.5 后移除。 - 前端列表库升级到支持 cursor","created":"2026-10-24T14:57:39.479Z","updated":"2026-10-24T15:57:39.479Z","status":"approved","submittedBy":"deepseek-harness","severity":"info","reason":"AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）"},{"path":"02-Projects/northstar-cache-sqlite.md","kind":"project","title":"northstar 缓存层选型：SQLite WAL 而不是 Redis","tags":["northstar","cache","sqlite","architecture"],"summary":"# northstar 缓存层选型：SQLite WAL 而不是 Redis\n\n## 决策\n\n单机部署下不引入 Redis：缓存和主库同一个 SQLite 文件，WAL 模式支持并发读，备份也只需要一个文件。 - 热点 key 用内存 LRU，持久层只存可重建的数据。 - 代价是跨进程共享缓存需要走数据库，压测后读延迟仍在可接受范围。 - 如果未来水平扩展，再把缓存抽成独立服务。","created":"2026-10-24T07:45:39.479Z","updated":"2026-10-24T08:45:39.479Z","status":"approved","submittedBy":"claude","severity":"info","reason":"AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）"},{"path":"02-Projects/northstar-local-gate.md","kind":"project","title":"部署流水线从 GitHub Actions 迁到本地门禁","tags":["northstar","deploy","ci","github-actions"],"summary":"# 部署流水线从 GitHub Actions 迁到本地门禁\n\n## 背景与结论\n\nActions 额度耗尽后，PR 页面长期一片红，团队开始忽略 CI。改为本地门禁 + 合并前脚本，PR 只保留一个轻量检查。 - 新增 `scripts/pre-merge-check.ps1`：构建、单测、迁移检查一次跑完。 - 合并前必须贴出脚本输出，CI 只做“可合并”标记。 - 结果：平均合并时间从 40 分钟降到 12 分钟，红灯噪音消失。","created":"2026-10-23T17:21:39.479Z","updated":"2026-10-23T18:21:39.479Z","status":"approved","submittedBy":"deepseek-harness","severity":"info","reason":"AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）"},{"path":"08-Mistakes/camera-roi-root-cause.md","kind":"mistake","title":"相机采集丢帧根因：开流顺序导致 ROI 静默失效","tags":["camera","gige","roi","root-cause"],"summary":"# 相机采集丢帧根因：开流顺序导致 ROI 静默失效\n\n## 根因\n\n现场状态栏显示 `1624×1240（配置 1280×720）`：配置没有生效。原因不是 ROI 参数写错，而是先开流、后设 ROI，相机忽略了后续设置。 - 正确顺序：停流 → 设置 Width/Height/Offset → 重新开流。 - 加一条启动断言：读取实际分辨率，和配置不一致就报错，不再静默跑。 - 带宽从 934 Mbps 降到 282 Mb","created":"2026-10-23T10:09:39.479Z","updated":"2026-10-23T11:09:39.479Z","status":"approved","submittedBy":"deepseek-harness","severity":"info","reason":"AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）"},{"path":"08-Mistakes/rust-upstream-default.md","kind":"mistake","title":"Rust 兼容上游新增字段：用 ..Default::default() 而非硬写字段","tags":["rust","upstream","default","northstar"],"summary":"# Rust 兼容上游新增字段：用 ..Default::default() 而非硬写字段\n\n## 教训\n\n上游给 `Cfg` 加了 `frontTokenName` 字段，本地旧代码构造结构体时直接报 E0063。 - 反模式：每加一个字段就在本地硬写一行，永远追不上。 - 正确做法：只在需要覆盖的字段上写值，其余用 `..Default::default()`。 - 顺手加一条 CI 检查：上游结构体字段变更时，编译失败比运行时缺字段更早暴露。","created":"2026-10-22T19:45:39.479Z","updated":"2026-10-22T20:45:39.479Z","status":"approved","submittedBy":"codex","severity":"info","reason":"AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）"},{"path":"03-Knowledge/mcp-tool-contract.md","kind":"knowledge","title":"MCP 工具描述要写成可执行契约","tags":["mcp","tools","schema","design"],"summary":"# MCP 工具描述要写成可执行契约\n\n## 结论\n\n工具描述不是说明书，是模型决定“什么时候调用、传什么参数”的唯一依据。 - 一句话说清“什么时候用”，再给一个最小参数示例。 - 错误要可行动：返回 `INVALID_ARGUMENT: limit 必须 1..20`，不要只返回 500。 - 把“不适用场景”也写进去，减少误调用比增加功能更重要。","created":"2026-10-22T12:33:39.479Z","updated":"2026-10-22T13:33:39.479Z","status":"approved","submittedBy":"deepseek-harness","severity":"info","reason":"AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）"},{"path":"05-Prompts/distill-card-prompt.md","kind":"prompt","title":"把长会话蒸馏成卡的提示词模板","tags":["prompt","distill","review","mcp"],"summary":"# 把长会话蒸馏成卡的提示词模板\n\n## 核心改动\n\n模板只保留三个字段：`decision`（决定了什么）、`evidence`（依据/实测）、`boundary`（适用边界）。 - 先让模型复述事实，再让它给结论，最后要求给出反例。 - 输出必须是 JSON；解析失败时退回原文卡，不要丢内容。 - 经验：字段越少，重复率越低，审核越快。","created":"2026-10-22T00:33:39.479Z","updated":"2026-10-22T01:33:39.479Z","status":"approved","submittedBy":"claude","severity":"info","reason":"AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）"},{"path":"03-Knowledge/ui-release-regression.md","kind":"knowledge","title":"UI 连发多版引发回归的三条纪律","tags":["ui","css","testing","regression"],"summary":"# UI 连发多版引发回归的三条纪律\n\n## 教训\n\n一天连发 6 个纯 UI 版本，业务代码没动，却出现滚动条错乱、按钮消失。根因是“源码测试通过”被当成了“界面正确”。 - 任何 UI 改动先跑截图验收，断言无横向溢出、无白屏、无 JS 异常。 - 改共享 CSS 类之前先列出使用者。 - 状态判断抽成纯函数，穷举组合测试，不靠肉眼。","created":"2026-10-21T14:57:39.479Z","updated":"2026-10-21T15:57:39.479Z","status":"approved","submittedBy":"deepseek-harness","severity":"info","reason":"AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）"},{"path":"07-Tools/sqlite-backup-checkpoint.md","kind":"tool","title":"SQLite WAL 模式下备份要 checkpoint","tags":["sqlite","backup","wal","ops"],"summary":"# SQLite WAL 模式下备份要 checkpoint\n\n## 要点\n\n直接拷 `.db` 文件在 WAL 模式下可能丢掉尚未 checkpoint 的内容。 - 备份前执行 `PRAGMA wal_checkpoint(TRUNCATE)`。 - 用 `VACUUM INTO` 生成一致性快照，再压缩归档。 - 恢复后跑一次完整性检查，别只看文件大小。","created":"2026-10-21T05:21:39.479Z","updated":"2026-10-21T06:21:39.479Z","status":"approved","submittedBy":"deepseek-harness","severity":"info","reason":"AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）"},{"path":"08-Mistakes/health-200-false-positive.md","kind":"mistake","title":"一次线上 500 的假成功：/health 200 不代表新镜像","tags":["deploy","health","docker","northstar"],"summary":"# 一次线上 500 的假成功：/health 200 不代表新镜像\n\n## 教训\n\n部署脚本打印 `/health = 200` 就认为成功，实际容器还是旧镜像。 - 200 只能证明“有个容器活着”，不能证明“新代码在跑”。 - 改用新代码独有的探针路由，再比对容器 image ID。 - 上传/load 失败必须显式退出，不能继续 compose。","created":"2026-10-20T17:21:39.479Z","updated":"2026-10-20T18:21:39.479Z","status":"approved","submittedBy":"codex","severity":"info","reason":"AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）"},{"path":"02-Projects/theme-tokens.md","kind":"project","title":"northstar 主题系统 token 化","tags":["ui","design-tokens","theme","northstar"],"summary":"# northstar 主题系统 token 化\n\n## 决策\n\n把散落在组件里的硬编码颜色收进一层 token：背景、文本、边框、状态、品牌色。 - 浅色和深色各自映射，不在组件里写 `if dark`。 - 只保留一个品牌强调色，状态色只表达状态。 - 迁移顺序：先 token 化按钮和输入，再改卡片与图表。","created":"2026-10-20T05:21:39.479Z","updated":"2026-10-20T06:21:39.479Z","status":"approved","submittedBy":"claude","severity":"info","reason":"AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）"},{"path":"07-Tools/playwright-real-backend.md","kind":"tool","title":"用 Playwright 做真实后端 E2E","tags":["e2e","playwright","testing","northstar"],"summary":"# 用 Playwright 做真实后端 E2E\n\n## 要点\n\nmock 测不出登录态、数据库约束和清理顺序问题。 - 只在设置 `E2E_API` 时跑真实栈，平时自动 skip。 - 登录用 localStorage 注入，避免每个用例点一遍表单。 - 测试数据用固定前缀，结束后 psql 清理，失败也清理。","created":"2026-10-19T19:45:39.479Z","updated":"2026-10-19T20:45:39.479Z","status":"approved","submittedBy":"claude","severity":"info","reason":"AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）"},{"path":"02-Projects/release-2-4.md","kind":"project","title":"northstar 发布 2.4.0：迁移与回滚","tags":["release","migration","northstar","ops"],"summary":"# northstar 发布 2.4.0：迁移与回滚\n\n## 结果\n\n2.4.0 上线 0 停机，迁移耗时 38 秒，回滚脚本实测可用。 - 迁移拆成“加列/回填/切换读/删旧列”四步，任何一步都能停。 - 发布前在影子库跑一遍全量迁移。 - 发布后 30 分钟观察错误率和慢查询，再放量。","created":"2026-10-19T07:45:39.479Z","updated":"2026-10-19T08:45:39.479Z","status":"approved","submittedBy":"deepseek-harness","severity":"info","reason":"AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）"},{"path":"03-Knowledge/pr-checklist.md","kind":"knowledge","title":"PR 合并前必须核对的 7 件事","tags":["review","checklist","git","northstar"],"summary":"# PR 合并前必须核对的 7 件事\n\n## 要点\n\n合并前固定核对：构建、单测、迁移、回滚、日志、权限、文档。 - 任何一项没有输出就算没做。 - 不合并“只差一个测试”的 PR，除非有明确的豁免记录。 - 合并后立刻回灌镜像，避免主仓和部署副本漂移。","created":"2026-10-18T19:45:39.479Z","updated":"2026-10-18T20:45:39.479Z","status":"approved","submittedBy":"codex","severity":"info","reason":"AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）"},{"path":"02-Projects/search-slow-query.md","kind":"project","title":"northstar 搜索慢查询：tags 的反向索引","tags":["search","sqlite","index","northstar"],"summary":"# northstar 搜索慢查询：tags 的反向索引\n\n## 根因\n\n标签筛选从 80ms 涨到 1.8s，根因是 `LIKE '%tag%'` 无法走索引。 - 建 `card_tags(card_id, tag)` 反向表，按 tag 先查 card_id。 - 多标签用交集，而不是 OR 后再过滤。 - 用 `EXPLAIN QUERY PLAN` 守住“全表扫描”回归。","created":"2026-10-18T10:09:39.479Z","updated":"2026-10-18T11:09:39.479Z","status":"approved","submittedBy":"deepseek-harness","severity":"info","reason":"AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）"},{"path":"03-Knowledge/camera-events.md","kind":"knowledge","title":"相机 SDK 的异常事件回调","tags":["camera","sdk","events","northstar"],"summary":"# 相机 SDK 的异常事件回调\n\n## 结论\n\n只靠取帧超时发现掉线，平均要 1.5 秒；打开 SDK 的异常事件回调后，拔线 200ms 内就能告警。 - 回调里只做标记，重连交给状态机。 - 回调可能重复触发，需要去抖。 - 事件线程不要做 UI 操作，避免死锁。","created":"2026-10-17T22:09:39.479Z","updated":"2026-10-17T23:09:39.479Z","status":"approved","submittedBy":"deepseek-harness","severity":"info","reason":"AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）"},{"path":"02-Projects/mobile-single-column.md","kind":"project","title":"northstar 移动端单列布局修复","tags":["ui","mobile","layout","northstar"],"summary":"# northstar 移动端单列布局修复\n\n## 背景与结论\n\n390px 下侧栏常开、统计卡纵向堆叠，首屏看不到内容。改为底部 4 个 tab，统计压成一行数字。 - 卡片单列，按钮最小 36px。 - 结果行不再放键盘快捷键提示。 - 用真实手机宽度跑截图验收，不靠桌面缩放。","created":"2026-10-17T14:57:39.479Z","updated":"2026-10-17T15:57:39.479Z","status":"approved","submittedBy":"claude","severity":"info","reason":"AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）"},{"path":"05-Prompts/review-card-fields.md","kind":"prompt","title":"把 AI 的回答变成可审核卡的 3 个字段","tags":["prompt","review","schema","northstar"],"summary":"# 把 AI 的回答变成可审核卡的 3 个字段\n\n## 核心改动\n\n只让模型输出 `decision`、`evidence`、`boundary` 三个字段，其他内容进原文。 - 审核时先看 decision，再看 evidence 是否支撑。 - boundary 必填，避免把一次实验当成通用结论。 - 字段缺失直接判为不合格，不让模型自由发挥。","created":"2026-10-17T00:33:39.479Z","updated":"2026-10-17T01:33:39.479Z","status":"approved","submittedBy":"claude","severity":"info","reason":"AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）"},{"path":"07-Tools/log-sampling.md","kind":"tool","title":"northstar 日志分级与采样","tags":["logs","observability","sampling","northstar"],"summary":"# northstar 日志分级与采样\n\n## 决策\n\n请求日志全量写会让磁盘一周涨 30GB；改为 error 全量、warn 10%、info 1%。 - 采样键用 request id，保证同一条链路可追踪。 - 关键业务事件不采样。 - 日志保留 14 天，超期归档到冷存储。","created":"2026-10-16T12:33:39.479Z","updated":"2026-10-16T13:33:39.479Z","status":"approved","submittedBy":"deepseek-harness","severity":"info","reason":"AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）"},{"path":"04-Content/docs-navigation.md","kind":"content","title":"northstar 文档站导航重构","tags":["docs","navigation","content","northstar"],"summary":"# northstar 文档站导航重构\n\n## 背景与结论\n\n文档从 12 个一级入口收成 4 个：开始、指南、参考、更新。搜索放在顶部固定位置。 - 新用户从首页到“跑起来”最多 3 次点击。 - 每个页面加“最后更新”和“适用版本”。 - 旧链接保留重定向，不制造 404。","created":"2026-10-15T19:45:39.479Z","updated":"2026-10-15T20:45:39.479Z","status":"approved","submittedBy":"claude","severity":"info","reason":"AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）"},{"path":"02-Projects/auth-policy.md","kind":"project","title":"northstar 权限模型：角色 vs 策略","tags":["auth","rbac","security","northstar"],"summary":"# northstar 权限模型：角色 vs 策略\n\n## 决策\n\n不引入完整的 RBAC 表，先用“策略函数”表达权限：`can(user, action, resource)`。 - 默认拒绝，所有放行都要有测试。 - 角色只是策略的预设组合，不直接进数据库。 - 等权限规则超过 20 条再考虑持久化。","created":"2026-10-14T14:57:39.479Z","updated":"2026-10-14T15:57:39.479Z","status":"approved","submittedBy":"deepseek-harness","severity":"info","reason":"AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）"},{"path":"03-Knowledge/pg-index-bloat.md","kind":"knowledge","title":"Postgres 索引膨胀的排查路径","tags":["postgres","index","performance","northstar"],"summary":"# Postgres 索引膨胀的排查路径\n\n## 根因\n\n写入放大后索引体积翻倍，查询反而变慢。根因是 autovacuum 跟不上，死元组留在索引里。 - 先看 `pg_stat_user_tables` 的 dead tuple 和 last_autovacuum。 - 对大表调低 autovacuum 阈值，分批 reindex。 - 用 `pg_repack` 避免长时间锁表。","created":"2026-10-13T19:45:39.479Z","updated":"2026-10-13T20:45:39.479Z","status":"approved","submittedBy":"codex","severity":"info","reason":"AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）"},{"path":"02-Projects/feature-flag.md","kind":"project","title":"northstar 灰度发布开关设计","tags":["release","feature-flag","risk","northstar"],"summary":"# northstar 灰度发布开关设计\n\n## 决策\n\n每个高风险功能必须有 kill switch，按用户/租户/百分比三档放量。 - 开关状态变更写审计日志。 - 默认关闭，发布后手动打开。 - 开关过期时间强制填写，避免永久残留。","created":"2026-10-12T19:45:39.479Z","updated":"2026-10-12T20:45:39.479Z","status":"approved","submittedBy":"deepseek-harness","severity":"info","reason":"AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）"},{"path":"08-Mistakes/incident-delete.md","kind":"mistake","title":"一次误删生产数据的复盘","tags":["incident","backup","postmortem","northstar"],"summary":"# 一次误删生产数据的复盘\n\n## 教训\n\n清理脚本少了一个 `WHERE`，删掉了 3 天的订单草稿。恢复花了 40 分钟。 - 所有删除先软删，30 天后才物理清理。 - 生产写操作默认 dry-run，必须显式加 `--apply`。 - 备份恢复要定期演练，不能只验证备份文件存在。","created":"2026-10-11T14:57:39.479Z","updated":"2026-10-11T15:57:39.479Z","status":"approved","submittedBy":"claude","severity":"info","reason":"AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）"}],"graphCards":[{"path":"02-Projects/northstar-cursor-pagination.md","kind":"project","title":"northstar API 分页从 offset 改为 cursor","tags":["northstar","api","pagination","sqlite"],"summary":"# northstar API 分页从 offset 改为 cursor\n\n## 决策\n\n把 `/api/items` 的分页从 `offset/limit` 改为 `cursor`：offset 在深度翻页时会因为并发写入重复或漏项。 - cursor 使用 `(updated_at, id)` 复合键，排序稳定。 - 兼容期保留 `offset`，响应头返回 `next_cursor`，2.5 后移除。 - 前端列表库升级到支持 cursor","created":"2026-10-24T14:57:39.479Z","updated":"2026-10-24T15:57:39.479Z","status":"approved","submittedBy":"deepseek-harness","severity":"info","reason":"AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）"},{"path":"02-Projects/northstar-cache-sqlite.md","kind":"project","title":"northstar 缓存层选型：SQLite WAL 而不是 Redis","tags":["northstar","cache","sqlite","architecture"],"summary":"# northstar 缓存层选型：SQLite WAL 而不是 Redis\n\n## 决策\n\n单机部署下不引入 Redis：缓存和主库同一个 SQLite 文件，WAL 模式支持并发读，备份也只需要一个文件。 - 热点 key 用内存 LRU，持久层只存可重建的数据。 - 代价是跨进程共享缓存需要走数据库，压测后读延迟仍在可接受范围。 - 如果未来水平扩展，再把缓存抽成独立服务。","created":"2026-10-24T07:45:39.479Z","updated":"2026-10-24T08:45:39.479Z","status":"approved","submittedBy":"claude","severity":"info","reason":"AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）"},{"path":"02-Projects/northstar-local-gate.md","kind":"project","title":"部署流水线从 GitHub Actions 迁到本地门禁","tags":["northstar","deploy","ci","github-actions"],"summary":"# 部署流水线从 GitHub Actions 迁到本地门禁\n\n## 背景与结论\n\nActions 额度耗尽后，PR 页面长期一片红，团队开始忽略 CI。改为本地门禁 + 合并前脚本，PR 只保留一个轻量检查。 - 新增 `scripts/pre-merge-check.ps1`：构建、单测、迁移检查一次跑完。 - 合并前必须贴出脚本输出，CI 只做“可合并”标记。 - 结果：平均合并时间从 40 分钟降到 12 分钟，红灯噪音消失。","created":"2026-10-23T17:21:39.479Z","updated":"2026-10-23T18:21:39.479Z","status":"approved","submittedBy":"deepseek-harness","severity":"info","reason":"AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）"},{"path":"08-Mistakes/camera-roi-root-cause.md","kind":"mistake","title":"相机采集丢帧根因：开流顺序导致 ROI 静默失效","tags":["camera","gige","roi","root-cause"],"summary":"# 相机采集丢帧根因：开流顺序导致 ROI 静默失效\n\n## 根因\n\n现场状态栏显示 `1624×1240（配置 1280×720）`：配置没有生效。原因不是 ROI 参数写错，而是先开流、后设 ROI，相机忽略了后续设置。 - 正确顺序：停流 → 设置 Width/Height/Offset → 重新开流。 - 加一条启动断言：读取实际分辨率，和配置不一致就报错，不再静默跑。 - 带宽从 934 Mbps 降到 282 Mb","created":"2026-10-23T10:09:39.479Z","updated":"2026-10-23T11:09:39.479Z","status":"approved","submittedBy":"deepseek-harness","severity":"info","reason":"AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）"},{"path":"08-Mistakes/rust-upstream-default.md","kind":"mistake","title":"Rust 兼容上游新增字段：用 ..Default::default() 而非硬写字段","tags":["rust","upstream","default","northstar"],"summary":"# Rust 兼容上游新增字段：用 ..Default::default() 而非硬写字段\n\n## 教训\n\n上游给 `Cfg` 加了 `frontTokenName` 字段，本地旧代码构造结构体时直接报 E0063。 - 反模式：每加一个字段就在本地硬写一行，永远追不上。 - 正确做法：只在需要覆盖的字段上写值，其余用 `..Default::default()`。 - 顺手加一条 CI 检查：上游结构体字段变更时，编译失败比运行时缺字段更早暴露。","created":"2026-10-22T19:45:39.479Z","updated":"2026-10-22T20:45:39.479Z","status":"approved","submittedBy":"codex","severity":"info","reason":"AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）"},{"path":"03-Knowledge/mcp-tool-contract.md","kind":"knowledge","title":"MCP 工具描述要写成可执行契约","tags":["mcp","tools","schema","design"],"summary":"# MCP 工具描述要写成可执行契约\n\n## 结论\n\n工具描述不是说明书，是模型决定“什么时候调用、传什么参数”的唯一依据。 - 一句话说清“什么时候用”，再给一个最小参数示例。 - 错误要可行动：返回 `INVALID_ARGUMENT: limit 必须 1..20`，不要只返回 500。 - 把“不适用场景”也写进去，减少误调用比增加功能更重要。","created":"2026-10-22T12:33:39.479Z","updated":"2026-10-22T13:33:39.479Z","status":"approved","submittedBy":"deepseek-harness","severity":"info","reason":"AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）"},{"path":"05-Prompts/distill-card-prompt.md","kind":"prompt","title":"把长会话蒸馏成卡的提示词模板","tags":["prompt","distill","review","mcp"],"summary":"# 把长会话蒸馏成卡的提示词模板\n\n## 核心改动\n\n模板只保留三个字段：`decision`（决定了什么）、`evidence`（依据/实测）、`boundary`（适用边界）。 - 先让模型复述事实，再让它给结论，最后要求给出反例。 - 输出必须是 JSON；解析失败时退回原文卡，不要丢内容。 - 经验：字段越少，重复率越低，审核越快。","created":"2026-10-22T00:33:39.479Z","updated":"2026-10-22T01:33:39.479Z","status":"approved","submittedBy":"claude","severity":"info","reason":"AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）"},{"path":"03-Knowledge/ui-release-regression.md","kind":"knowledge","title":"UI 连发多版引发回归的三条纪律","tags":["ui","css","testing","regression"],"summary":"# UI 连发多版引发回归的三条纪律\n\n## 教训\n\n一天连发 6 个纯 UI 版本，业务代码没动，却出现滚动条错乱、按钮消失。根因是“源码测试通过”被当成了“界面正确”。 - 任何 UI 改动先跑截图验收，断言无横向溢出、无白屏、无 JS 异常。 - 改共享 CSS 类之前先列出使用者。 - 状态判断抽成纯函数，穷举组合测试，不靠肉眼。","created":"2026-10-21T14:57:39.479Z","updated":"2026-10-21T15:57:39.479Z","status":"approved","submittedBy":"deepseek-harness","severity":"info","reason":"AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）"},{"path":"07-Tools/sqlite-backup-checkpoint.md","kind":"tool","title":"SQLite WAL 模式下备份要 checkpoint","tags":["sqlite","backup","wal","ops"],"summary":"# SQLite WAL 模式下备份要 checkpoint\n\n## 要点\n\n直接拷 `.db` 文件在 WAL 模式下可能丢掉尚未 checkpoint 的内容。 - 备份前执行 `PRAGMA wal_checkpoint(TRUNCATE)`。 - 用 `VACUUM INTO` 生成一致性快照，再压缩归档。 - 恢复后跑一次完整性检查，别只看文件大小。","created":"2026-10-21T05:21:39.479Z","updated":"2026-10-21T06:21:39.479Z","status":"approved","submittedBy":"deepseek-harness","severity":"info","reason":"AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）"},{"path":"08-Mistakes/health-200-false-positive.md","kind":"mistake","title":"一次线上 500 的假成功：/health 200 不代表新镜像","tags":["deploy","health","docker","northstar"],"summary":"# 一次线上 500 的假成功：/health 200 不代表新镜像\n\n## 教训\n\n部署脚本打印 `/health = 200` 就认为成功，实际容器还是旧镜像。 - 200 只能证明“有个容器活着”，不能证明“新代码在跑”。 - 改用新代码独有的探针路由，再比对容器 image ID。 - 上传/load 失败必须显式退出，不能继续 compose。","created":"2026-10-20T17:21:39.479Z","updated":"2026-10-20T18:21:39.479Z","status":"approved","submittedBy":"codex","severity":"info","reason":"AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）"},{"path":"02-Projects/theme-tokens.md","kind":"project","title":"northstar 主题系统 token 化","tags":["ui","design-tokens","theme","northstar"],"summary":"# northstar 主题系统 token 化\n\n## 决策\n\n把散落在组件里的硬编码颜色收进一层 token：背景、文本、边框、状态、品牌色。 - 浅色和深色各自映射，不在组件里写 `if dark`。 - 只保留一个品牌强调色，状态色只表达状态。 - 迁移顺序：先 token 化按钮和输入，再改卡片与图表。","created":"2026-10-20T05:21:39.479Z","updated":"2026-10-20T06:21:39.479Z","status":"approved","submittedBy":"claude","severity":"info","reason":"AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）"},{"path":"07-Tools/playwright-real-backend.md","kind":"tool","title":"用 Playwright 做真实后端 E2E","tags":["e2e","playwright","testing","northstar"],"summary":"# 用 Playwright 做真实后端 E2E\n\n## 要点\n\nmock 测不出登录态、数据库约束和清理顺序问题。 - 只在设置 `E2E_API` 时跑真实栈，平时自动 skip。 - 登录用 localStorage 注入，避免每个用例点一遍表单。 - 测试数据用固定前缀，结束后 psql 清理，失败也清理。","created":"2026-10-19T19:45:39.479Z","updated":"2026-10-19T20:45:39.479Z","status":"approved","submittedBy":"claude","severity":"info","reason":"AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）"},{"path":"02-Projects/release-2-4.md","kind":"project","title":"northstar 发布 2.4.0：迁移与回滚","tags":["release","migration","northstar","ops"],"summary":"# northstar 发布 2.4.0：迁移与回滚\n\n## 结果\n\n2.4.0 上线 0 停机，迁移耗时 38 秒，回滚脚本实测可用。 - 迁移拆成“加列/回填/切换读/删旧列”四步，任何一步都能停。 - 发布前在影子库跑一遍全量迁移。 - 发布后 30 分钟观察错误率和慢查询，再放量。","created":"2026-10-19T07:45:39.479Z","updated":"2026-10-19T08:45:39.479Z","status":"approved","submittedBy":"deepseek-harness","severity":"info","reason":"AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）"},{"path":"03-Knowledge/pr-checklist.md","kind":"knowledge","title":"PR 合并前必须核对的 7 件事","tags":["review","checklist","git","northstar"],"summary":"# PR 合并前必须核对的 7 件事\n\n## 要点\n\n合并前固定核对：构建、单测、迁移、回滚、日志、权限、文档。 - 任何一项没有输出就算没做。 - 不合并“只差一个测试”的 PR，除非有明确的豁免记录。 - 合并后立刻回灌镜像，避免主仓和部署副本漂移。","created":"2026-10-18T19:45:39.479Z","updated":"2026-10-18T20:45:39.479Z","status":"approved","submittedBy":"codex","severity":"info","reason":"AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）"},{"path":"02-Projects/search-slow-query.md","kind":"project","title":"northstar 搜索慢查询：tags 的反向索引","tags":["search","sqlite","index","northstar"],"summary":"# northstar 搜索慢查询：tags 的反向索引\n\n## 根因\n\n标签筛选从 80ms 涨到 1.8s，根因是 `LIKE '%tag%'` 无法走索引。 - 建 `card_tags(card_id, tag)` 反向表，按 tag 先查 card_id。 - 多标签用交集，而不是 OR 后再过滤。 - 用 `EXPLAIN QUERY PLAN` 守住“全表扫描”回归。","created":"2026-10-18T10:09:39.479Z","updated":"2026-10-18T11:09:39.479Z","status":"approved","submittedBy":"deepseek-harness","severity":"info","reason":"AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）"},{"path":"03-Knowledge/camera-events.md","kind":"knowledge","title":"相机 SDK 的异常事件回调","tags":["camera","sdk","events","northstar"],"summary":"# 相机 SDK 的异常事件回调\n\n## 结论\n\n只靠取帧超时发现掉线，平均要 1.5 秒；打开 SDK 的异常事件回调后，拔线 200ms 内就能告警。 - 回调里只做标记，重连交给状态机。 - 回调可能重复触发，需要去抖。 - 事件线程不要做 UI 操作，避免死锁。","created":"2026-10-17T22:09:39.479Z","updated":"2026-10-17T23:09:39.479Z","status":"approved","submittedBy":"deepseek-harness","severity":"info","reason":"AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）"},{"path":"02-Projects/mobile-single-column.md","kind":"project","title":"northstar 移动端单列布局修复","tags":["ui","mobile","layout","northstar"],"summary":"# northstar 移动端单列布局修复\n\n## 背景与结论\n\n390px 下侧栏常开、统计卡纵向堆叠，首屏看不到内容。改为底部 4 个 tab，统计压成一行数字。 - 卡片单列，按钮最小 36px。 - 结果行不再放键盘快捷键提示。 - 用真实手机宽度跑截图验收，不靠桌面缩放。","created":"2026-10-17T14:57:39.479Z","updated":"2026-10-17T15:57:39.479Z","status":"approved","submittedBy":"claude","severity":"info","reason":"AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）"},{"path":"05-Prompts/review-card-fields.md","kind":"prompt","title":"把 AI 的回答变成可审核卡的 3 个字段","tags":["prompt","review","schema","northstar"],"summary":"# 把 AI 的回答变成可审核卡的 3 个字段\n\n## 核心改动\n\n只让模型输出 `decision`、`evidence`、`boundary` 三个字段，其他内容进原文。 - 审核时先看 decision，再看 evidence 是否支撑。 - boundary 必填，避免把一次实验当成通用结论。 - 字段缺失直接判为不合格，不让模型自由发挥。","created":"2026-10-17T00:33:39.479Z","updated":"2026-10-17T01:33:39.479Z","status":"approved","submittedBy":"claude","severity":"info","reason":"AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）"},{"path":"07-Tools/log-sampling.md","kind":"tool","title":"northstar 日志分级与采样","tags":["logs","observability","sampling","northstar"],"summary":"# northstar 日志分级与采样\n\n## 决策\n\n请求日志全量写会让磁盘一周涨 30GB；改为 error 全量、warn 10%、info 1%。 - 采样键用 request id，保证同一条链路可追踪。 - 关键业务事件不采样。 - 日志保留 14 天，超期归档到冷存储。","created":"2026-10-16T12:33:39.479Z","updated":"2026-10-16T13:33:39.479Z","status":"approved","submittedBy":"deepseek-harness","severity":"info","reason":"AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）"},{"path":"04-Content/docs-navigation.md","kind":"content","title":"northstar 文档站导航重构","tags":["docs","navigation","content","northstar"],"summary":"# northstar 文档站导航重构\n\n## 背景与结论\n\n文档从 12 个一级入口收成 4 个：开始、指南、参考、更新。搜索放在顶部固定位置。 - 新用户从首页到“跑起来”最多 3 次点击。 - 每个页面加“最后更新”和“适用版本”。 - 旧链接保留重定向，不制造 404。","created":"2026-10-15T19:45:39.479Z","updated":"2026-10-15T20:45:39.479Z","status":"approved","submittedBy":"claude","severity":"info","reason":"AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）"},{"path":"02-Projects/auth-policy.md","kind":"project","title":"northstar 权限模型：角色 vs 策略","tags":["auth","rbac","security","northstar"],"summary":"# northstar 权限模型：角色 vs 策略\n\n## 决策\n\n不引入完整的 RBAC 表，先用“策略函数”表达权限：`can(user, action, resource)`。 - 默认拒绝，所有放行都要有测试。 - 角色只是策略的预设组合，不直接进数据库。 - 等权限规则超过 20 条再考虑持久化。","created":"2026-10-14T14:57:39.479Z","updated":"2026-10-14T15:57:39.479Z","status":"approved","submittedBy":"deepseek-harness","severity":"info","reason":"AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）"},{"path":"03-Knowledge/pg-index-bloat.md","kind":"knowledge","title":"Postgres 索引膨胀的排查路径","tags":["postgres","index","performance","northstar"],"summary":"# Postgres 索引膨胀的排查路径\n\n## 根因\n\n写入放大后索引体积翻倍，查询反而变慢。根因是 autovacuum 跟不上，死元组留在索引里。 - 先看 `pg_stat_user_tables` 的 dead tuple 和 last_autovacuum。 - 对大表调低 autovacuum 阈值，分批 reindex。 - 用 `pg_repack` 避免长时间锁表。","created":"2026-10-13T19:45:39.479Z","updated":"2026-10-13T20:45:39.479Z","status":"approved","submittedBy":"codex","severity":"info","reason":"AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）"},{"path":"02-Projects/feature-flag.md","kind":"project","title":"northstar 灰度发布开关设计","tags":["release","feature-flag","risk","northstar"],"summary":"# northstar 灰度发布开关设计\n\n## 决策\n\n每个高风险功能必须有 kill switch，按用户/租户/百分比三档放量。 - 开关状态变更写审计日志。 - 默认关闭，发布后手动打开。 - 开关过期时间强制填写，避免永久残留。","created":"2026-10-12T19:45:39.479Z","updated":"2026-10-12T20:45:39.479Z","status":"approved","submittedBy":"deepseek-harness","severity":"info","reason":"AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）"},{"path":"08-Mistakes/incident-delete.md","kind":"mistake","title":"一次误删生产数据的复盘","tags":["incident","backup","postmortem","northstar"],"summary":"# 一次误删生产数据的复盘\n\n## 教训\n\n清理脚本少了一个 `WHERE`，删掉了 3 天的订单草稿。恢复花了 40 分钟。 - 所有删除先软删，30 天后才物理清理。 - 生产写操作默认 dry-run，必须显式加 `--apply`。 - 备份恢复要定期演练，不能只验证备份文件存在。","created":"2026-10-11T14:57:39.479Z","updated":"2026-10-11T15:57:39.479Z","status":"approved","submittedBy":"claude","severity":"info","reason":"AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）"},{"path":"02-Projects/architecture-monolith-first.md","kind":"project","title":"northstar 早期架构：单体优先","tags":["architecture","northstar","sqlite"],"summary":"# northstar 早期架构：单体优先\n\n## 结论\n\n第一版坚持单体 + SQLite：没有消息队列、没有微服务、没有 Redis。 - 部署就是一个二进制 + 一个数据文件。 - 所有模块先在同一进程内调用，边界用接口约束。 - 等真的出现独立扩缩容需求，再拆。","created":"2026-09-08T19:45:39.479Z","updated":"2026-09-08T20:45:39.479Z","status":"approved","submittedBy":"deepseek-harness","severity":"info","reason":"AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）"},{"path":"03-Knowledge/search-simple-first.md","kind":"knowledge","title":"为什么先把搜索做简单","tags":["search","sqlite","northstar"],"summary":"# 为什么先把搜索做简单\n\n## 结论\n\n没有上向量库：先用 SQLite FTS + 标签过滤，把“能找到”做好。 - 结构化标签的召回质量比 embedding 更可控。 - 结果可解释：为什么命中、命中了哪些词。 - 等用户量证明需要语义检索，再引入向量。","created":"2026-09-02T19:45:39.479Z","updated":"2026-09-02T20:45:39.479Z","status":"approved","submittedBy":"claude","severity":"info","reason":"AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）"},{"path":"08-Mistakes/review-first-pitfalls.md","kind":"mistake","title":"第一版审核流的三个坑","tags":["review","workflow","northstar"],"summary":"# 第一版审核流的三个坑\n\n## 教训\n\n第一版审核只能看标题，用户被迫盲批；批量批准没有撤销；队列没有排序。 - 审核必须能读正文。 - 所有批量操作必须可撤销。 - 默认按时间倒序，别让用户猜。","created":"2026-08-27T19:45:39.479Z","updated":"2026-08-27T20:45:39.479Z","status":"approved","submittedBy":"deepseek-harness","severity":"info","reason":"AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）"},{"path":"07-Tools/backup-local-first.md","kind":"tool","title":"本地优先的备份策略","tags":["backup","local-first","sqlite"],"summary":"# 本地优先的备份策略\n\n## 要点\n\n每天自动备份，保留 7 天；备份文件带时间戳，恢复前先校验。 - 备份和主库不在同一个磁盘。 - 恢复流程写成脚本，不靠记忆。 - 每周抽查一次恢复。","created":"2026-08-20T19:45:39.479Z","updated":"2026-08-20T20:45:39.479Z","status":"approved","submittedBy":"deepseek-harness","severity":"info","reason":"AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）"},{"path":"04-Content/logs-as-product.md","kind":"content","title":"把日志当产品来设计","tags":["logs","product","northstar"],"summary":"# 把日志当产品来设计\n\n## 要点\n\n日志不是调试残留，是用户理解系统的界面。 - 一条日志回答：发生了什么、影响谁、下一步做什么。 - 错误日志必须带 request id。 - 不要打印完整 token 或用户隐私。","created":"2026-08-13T19:45:39.479Z","updated":"2026-08-13T20:45:39.479Z","status":"approved","submittedBy":"claude","severity":"info","reason":"AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）"},{"path":"02-Projects/v1-retro.md","kind":"project","title":"v1 发布复盘：哪些决定还成立","tags":["release","retro","northstar"],"summary":"# v1 发布复盘：哪些决定还成立\n\n## 结论\n\nv1 发布 3 个月后回看：单体、SQLite、审核优先、Markdown 可导出，四个决定仍然成立。 - 不成立的是“先不做搜索”，用户第一周就在找东西。 - 下一个版本优先补可解释召回。 - 不要把“以后再说”当成决定。","created":"2026-07-28T19:45:39.479Z","updated":"2026-07-28T20:45:39.479Z","status":"approved","submittedBy":"deepseek-harness","severity":"info","reason":"AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）"}],"oldCards":[{"path":"02-Projects/architecture-monolith-first.md","kind":"project","title":"northstar 早期架构：单体优先","tags":["architecture","northstar","sqlite"],"summary":"# northstar 早期架构：单体优先\n\n## 结论\n\n第一版坚持单体 + SQLite：没有消息队列、没有微服务、没有 Redis。 - 部署就是一个二进制 + 一个数据文件。 - 所有模块先在同一进程内调用，边界用接口约束。 - 等真的出现独立扩缩容需求，再拆。","created":"2026-09-08T19:45:39.479Z","updated":"2026-09-08T20:45:39.479Z","status":"approved","submittedBy":"deepseek-harness","severity":"info","reason":"AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）"},{"path":"03-Knowledge/search-simple-first.md","kind":"knowledge","title":"为什么先把搜索做简单","tags":["search","sqlite","northstar"],"summary":"# 为什么先把搜索做简单\n\n## 结论\n\n没有上向量库：先用 SQLite FTS + 标签过滤，把“能找到”做好。 - 结构化标签的召回质量比 embedding 更可控。 - 结果可解释：为什么命中、命中了哪些词。 - 等用户量证明需要语义检索，再引入向量。","created":"2026-09-02T19:45:39.479Z","updated":"2026-09-02T20:45:39.479Z","status":"approved","submittedBy":"claude","severity":"info","reason":"AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）"},{"path":"08-Mistakes/review-first-pitfalls.md","kind":"mistake","title":"第一版审核流的三个坑","tags":["review","workflow","northstar"],"summary":"# 第一版审核流的三个坑\n\n## 教训\n\n第一版审核只能看标题，用户被迫盲批；批量批准没有撤销；队列没有排序。 - 审核必须能读正文。 - 所有批量操作必须可撤销。 - 默认按时间倒序，别让用户猜。","created":"2026-08-27T19:45:39.479Z","updated":"2026-08-27T20:45:39.479Z","status":"approved","submittedBy":"deepseek-harness","severity":"info","reason":"AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）"},{"path":"07-Tools/backup-local-first.md","kind":"tool","title":"本地优先的备份策略","tags":["backup","local-first","sqlite"],"summary":"# 本地优先的备份策略\n\n## 要点\n\n每天自动备份，保留 7 天；备份文件带时间戳，恢复前先校验。 - 备份和主库不在同一个磁盘。 - 恢复流程写成脚本，不靠记忆。 - 每周抽查一次恢复。","created":"2026-08-20T19:45:39.479Z","updated":"2026-08-20T20:45:39.479Z","status":"approved","submittedBy":"deepseek-harness","severity":"info","reason":"AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）"},{"path":"04-Content/logs-as-product.md","kind":"content","title":"把日志当产品来设计","tags":["logs","product","northstar"],"summary":"# 把日志当产品来设计\n\n## 要点\n\n日志不是调试残留，是用户理解系统的界面。 - 一条日志回答：发生了什么、影响谁、下一步做什么。 - 错误日志必须带 request id。 - 不要打印完整 token 或用户隐私。","created":"2026-08-13T19:45:39.479Z","updated":"2026-08-13T20:45:39.479Z","status":"approved","submittedBy":"claude","severity":"info","reason":"AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）"},{"path":"02-Projects/v1-retro.md","kind":"project","title":"v1 发布复盘：哪些决定还成立","tags":["release","retro","northstar"],"summary":"# v1 发布复盘：哪些决定还成立\n\n## 结论\n\nv1 发布 3 个月后回看：单体、SQLite、审核优先、Markdown 可导出，四个决定仍然成立。 - 不成立的是“先不做搜索”，用户第一周就在找东西。 - 下一个版本优先补可解释召回。 - 不要把“以后再说”当成决定。","created":"2026-07-28T19:45:39.479Z","updated":"2026-07-28T20:45:39.479Z","status":"approved","submittedBy":"deepseek-harness","severity":"info","reason":"AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）"}],"pending":[{"path":"02-Projects/explainable-recall.md","kind":"project","title":"northstar 2.5 计划：把召回做成可解释的","tags":["northstar","recall","explainability"],"summary":"# northstar 2.5 计划：把召回做成可解释的\n\n## 背景与结论\n\n用户反馈“不知道为什么召回这张卡”。2.5 给每次召回加三个字段：命中词、共享标签、最后使用时间。 - 召回结果旁显示“为什么是它”。 - 支持用户点“不相关”，作为下一轮排序信号。 - 不引入黑盒向量分数，先做可解释的规则。","created":"2026-10-24T17:21:39.479Z","updated":"2026-10-24T18:21:39.479Z","status":"pending","submittedBy":"deepseek-harness","severity":"info","reason":"AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）"},{"path":"03-Knowledge/camera-sdk-2-4.md","kind":"knowledge","title":"相机 SDK 升级 2.4 的兼容性清单","tags":["camera","sdk","compatibility"],"summary":"# 相机 SDK 升级 2.4 的兼容性清单\n\n## 要点\n\nSDK 2.4 改了事件回调线程模型，升级前核对：回调线程、句柄释放顺序、异常码映射。 - 先在离线环境跑 24 小时拔插测试。 - 旧固件保留回滚包。 - 不要在线程回调里直接操作 UI。","created":"2026-10-24T14:57:39.479Z","updated":"2026-10-24T15:57:39.479Z","status":"pending","submittedBy":"codex","severity":"info","reason":"AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）"},{"path":"02-Projects/keyboard-audit.md","kind":"project","title":"把审核中心做成键盘优先","tags":["review","keyboard","ux"],"summary":"# 把审核中心做成键盘优先\n\n## 决策\n\n审核是高频动作，鼠标逐行点太低效。默认支持 J/K 切换、A 批准、R 驳回。 - 焦点始终可见。 - 批量操作保留确认与撤销。 - 快捷键在界面上可发现，不靠记忆。","created":"2026-10-24T12:33:39.479Z","updated":"2026-10-24T13:33:39.479Z","status":"pending","submittedBy":"claude","severity":"info","reason":"AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）"},{"path":"03-Knowledge/sqlite-cjk-search.md","kind":"knowledge","title":"SQLite 全文检索中文分词方案","tags":["sqlite","cjk","search"],"summary":"# SQLite 全文检索中文分词方案\n\n## 根因\n\nSQLite FTS5 默认分词对中文不友好，整句被当成一个 token。 - 方案 A：写入时按 2-gram 切分，召回高但索引大。 - 方案 B：外部分词后存 token 列，查询走 LIKE 前缀。 - 先测召回和体积，再选。","created":"2026-10-24T10:09:39.479Z","updated":"2026-10-24T11:09:39.479Z","status":"pending","submittedBy":"deepseek-harness","severity":"info","reason":"AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）"},{"path":"04-Content/release-notes-template.md","kind":"content","title":"发布说明模板 v2","tags":["release","notes","template"],"summary":"# 发布说明模板 v2\n\n## 要点\n\n发布说明固定四段：一句话结论、用户可感知变化、升级注意、回滚方式。 - 不贴提交列表。 - 每个变化都写“对用户意味着什么”。 - 附上升级命令。","created":"2026-10-24T07:45:39.479Z","updated":"2026-10-24T08:45:39.479Z","status":"pending","submittedBy":"claude","severity":"info","reason":"AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）"}],"rejected":[{"path":"04-Content/user-note-raw.md","kind":"content","title":"用户：把这个记一下","tags":["raw"],"summary":"# 用户：把这个记一下\n\n## 摘要\n\n用户：把这个记一下。","created":"2026-10-15T19:45:39.479Z","updated":"2026-10-15T20:45:39.479Z","status":"rejected","submittedBy":"claude","severity":"info","reason":"AI 自动沉淀（原文卡）"},{"path":"04-Content/temp-test-card.md","kind":"content","title":"临时测试卡","tags":["raw"],"summary":"# 临时测试卡\n\n## 摘要\n\n测试自动沉淀。","created":"2026-10-10T19:45:39.479Z","updated":"2026-10-10T20:45:39.479Z","status":"rejected","submittedBy":"codex","severity":"info","reason":"AI 自动沉淀（原文卡）"}],"bodies":{"02-Projects/northstar-cursor-pagination.md":"---\nformatVersion: 1\nkind: project\ntitle: northstar API 分页从 offset 改为 cursor\ntags: [northstar, api, pagination, sqlite]\ncreated: 2026-10-24T14:57:39.479Z\nupdated: 2026-10-24T15:57:39.479Z\nstatus: approved\nsubmittedBy: deepseek-harness\nreason: AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）\nsource: deepseek-harness\n---\n\n# northstar API 分页从 offset 改为 cursor\n\n## 决策\n\n把 `/api/items` 的分页从 `offset/limit` 改为 `cursor`：offset 在深度翻页时会因为并发写入重复或漏项。\n\n- cursor 使用 `(updated_at, id)` 复合键，排序稳定。\n- 兼容期保留 `offset`，响应头返回 `next_cursor`，2.5 后移除。\n- 前端列表库升级到支持 cursor 的版本，旧客户端仍能工作。","02-Projects/northstar-cache-sqlite.md":"---\nformatVersion: 1\nkind: project\ntitle: northstar 缓存层选型：SQLite WAL 而不是 Redis\ntags: [northstar, cache, sqlite, architecture]\ncreated: 2026-10-24T07:45:39.479Z\nupdated: 2026-10-24T08:45:39.479Z\nstatus: approved\nsubmittedBy: claude\nreason: AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）\nsource: claude\n---\n\n# northstar 缓存层选型：SQLite WAL 而不是 Redis\n\n## 决策\n\n单机部署下不引入 Redis：缓存和主库同一个 SQLite 文件，WAL 模式支持并发读，备份也只需要一个文件。\n\n- 热点 key 用内存 LRU，持久层只存可重建的数据。\n- 代价是跨进程共享缓存需要走数据库，压测后读延迟仍在可接受范围。\n- 如果未来水平扩展，再把缓存抽成独立服务。","02-Projects/northstar-local-gate.md":"---\nformatVersion: 1\nkind: project\ntitle: 部署流水线从 GitHub Actions 迁到本地门禁\ntags: [northstar, deploy, ci, github-actions]\ncreated: 2026-10-23T17:21:39.479Z\nupdated: 2026-10-23T18:21:39.479Z\nstatus: approved\nsubmittedBy: deepseek-harness\nreason: AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）\nsource: deepseek-harness\n---\n\n# 部署流水线从 GitHub Actions 迁到本地门禁\n\n## 背景与结论\n\nActions 额度耗尽后，PR 页面长期一片红，团队开始忽略 CI。改为本地门禁 + 合并前脚本，PR 只保留一个轻量检查。\n\n- 新增 `scripts/pre-merge-check.ps1`：构建、单测、迁移检查一次跑完。\n- 合并前必须贴出脚本输出，CI 只做“可合并”标记。\n- 结果：平均合并时间从 40 分钟降到 12 分钟，红灯噪音消失。","08-Mistakes/camera-roi-root-cause.md":"---\nformatVersion: 1\nkind: mistake\ntitle: 相机采集丢帧根因：开流顺序导致 ROI 静默失效\ntags: [camera, gige, roi, root-cause]\ncreated: 2026-10-23T10:09:39.479Z\nupdated: 2026-10-23T11:09:39.479Z\nstatus: approved\nsubmittedBy: deepseek-harness\nreason: AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）\nsource: deepseek-harness\n---\n\n# 相机采集丢帧根因：开流顺序导致 ROI 静默失效\n\n## 根因\n\n现场状态栏显示 `1624×1240（配置 1280×720）`：配置没有生效。原因不是 ROI 参数写错，而是先开流、后设 ROI，相机忽略了后续设置。\n\n- 正确顺序：停流 → 设置 Width/Height/Offset → 重新开流。\n- 加一条启动断言：读取实际分辨率，和配置不一致就报错，不再静默跑。\n- 带宽从 934 Mbps 降到 282 Mbps，丢包归零。","08-Mistakes/rust-upstream-default.md":"---\nformatVersion: 1\nkind: mistake\ntitle: Rust 兼容上游新增字段：用 ..Default::default() 而非硬写字段\ntags: [rust, upstream, default, northstar]\ncreated: 2026-10-22T19:45:39.479Z\nupdated: 2026-10-22T20:45:39.479Z\nstatus: approved\nsubmittedBy: codex\nreason: AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）\nsource: codex\n---\n\n# Rust 兼容上游新增字段：用 ..Default::default() 而非硬写字段\n\n## 教训\n\n上游给 `Cfg` 加了 `frontTokenName` 字段，本地旧代码构造结构体时直接报 E0063。\n\n- 反模式：每加一个字段就在本地硬写一行，永远追不上。\n- 正确做法：只在需要覆盖的字段上写值，其余用 `..Default::default()`。\n- 顺手加一条 CI 检查：上游结构体字段变更时，编译失败比运行时缺字段更早暴露。","03-Knowledge/mcp-tool-contract.md":"---\nformatVersion: 1\nkind: knowledge\ntitle: MCP 工具描述要写成可执行契约\ntags: [mcp, tools, schema, design]\ncreated: 2026-10-22T12:33:39.479Z\nupdated: 2026-10-22T13:33:39.479Z\nstatus: approved\nsubmittedBy: deepseek-harness\nreason: AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）\nsource: deepseek-harness\n---\n\n# MCP 工具描述要写成可执行契约\n\n## 结论\n\n工具描述不是说明书，是模型决定“什么时候调用、传什么参数”的唯一依据。\n\n- 一句话说清“什么时候用”，再给一个最小参数示例。\n- 错误要可行动：返回 `INVALID_ARGUMENT: limit 必须 1..20`，不要只返回 500。\n- 把“不适用场景”也写进去，减少误调用比增加功能更重要。","05-Prompts/distill-card-prompt.md":"---\nformatVersion: 1\nkind: prompt\ntitle: 把长会话蒸馏成卡的提示词模板\ntags: [prompt, distill, review, mcp]\ncreated: 2026-10-22T00:33:39.479Z\nupdated: 2026-10-22T01:33:39.479Z\nstatus: approved\nsubmittedBy: claude\nreason: AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）\nsource: claude\n---\n\n# 把长会话蒸馏成卡的提示词模板\n\n## 核心改动\n\n模板只保留三个字段：`decision`（决定了什么）、`evidence`（依据/实测）、`boundary`（适用边界）。\n\n- 先让模型复述事实，再让它给结论，最后要求给出反例。\n- 输出必须是 JSON；解析失败时退回原文卡，不要丢内容。\n- 经验：字段越少，重复率越低，审核越快。","03-Knowledge/ui-release-regression.md":"---\nformatVersion: 1\nkind: knowledge\ntitle: UI 连发多版引发回归的三条纪律\ntags: [ui, css, testing, regression]\ncreated: 2026-10-21T14:57:39.479Z\nupdated: 2026-10-21T15:57:39.479Z\nstatus: approved\nsubmittedBy: deepseek-harness\nreason: AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）\nsource: deepseek-harness\n---\n\n# UI 连发多版引发回归的三条纪律\n\n## 教训\n\n一天连发 6 个纯 UI 版本，业务代码没动，却出现滚动条错乱、按钮消失。根因是“源码测试通过”被当成了“界面正确”。\n\n- 任何 UI 改动先跑截图验收，断言无横向溢出、无白屏、无 JS 异常。\n- 改共享 CSS 类之前先列出使用者。\n- 状态判断抽成纯函数，穷举组合测试，不靠肉眼。","07-Tools/sqlite-backup-checkpoint.md":"---\nformatVersion: 1\nkind: tool\ntitle: SQLite WAL 模式下备份要 checkpoint\ntags: [sqlite, backup, wal, ops]\ncreated: 2026-10-21T05:21:39.479Z\nupdated: 2026-10-21T06:21:39.479Z\nstatus: approved\nsubmittedBy: deepseek-harness\nreason: AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）\nsource: deepseek-harness\n---\n\n# SQLite WAL 模式下备份要 checkpoint\n\n## 要点\n\n直接拷 `.db` 文件在 WAL 模式下可能丢掉尚未 checkpoint 的内容。\n\n- 备份前执行 `PRAGMA wal_checkpoint(TRUNCATE)`。\n- 用 `VACUUM INTO` 生成一致性快照，再压缩归档。\n- 恢复后跑一次完整性检查，别只看文件大小。","08-Mistakes/health-200-false-positive.md":"---\nformatVersion: 1\nkind: mistake\ntitle: 一次线上 500 的假成功：/health 200 不代表新镜像\ntags: [deploy, health, docker, northstar]\ncreated: 2026-10-20T17:21:39.479Z\nupdated: 2026-10-20T18:21:39.479Z\nstatus: approved\nsubmittedBy: codex\nreason: AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）\nsource: codex\n---\n\n# 一次线上 500 的假成功：/health 200 不代表新镜像\n\n## 教训\n\n部署脚本打印 `/health = 200` 就认为成功，实际容器还是旧镜像。\n\n- 200 只能证明“有个容器活着”，不能证明“新代码在跑”。\n- 改用新代码独有的探针路由，再比对容器 image ID。\n- 上传/load 失败必须显式退出，不能继续 compose。","02-Projects/theme-tokens.md":"---\nformatVersion: 1\nkind: project\ntitle: northstar 主题系统 token 化\ntags: [ui, design-tokens, theme, northstar]\ncreated: 2026-10-20T05:21:39.479Z\nupdated: 2026-10-20T06:21:39.479Z\nstatus: approved\nsubmittedBy: claude\nreason: AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）\nsource: claude\n---\n\n# northstar 主题系统 token 化\n\n## 决策\n\n把散落在组件里的硬编码颜色收进一层 token：背景、文本、边框、状态、品牌色。\n\n- 浅色和深色各自映射，不在组件里写 `if dark`。\n- 只保留一个品牌强调色，状态色只表达状态。\n- 迁移顺序：先 token 化按钮和输入，再改卡片与图表。","07-Tools/playwright-real-backend.md":"---\nformatVersion: 1\nkind: tool\ntitle: 用 Playwright 做真实后端 E2E\ntags: [e2e, playwright, testing, northstar]\ncreated: 2026-10-19T19:45:39.479Z\nupdated: 2026-10-19T20:45:39.479Z\nstatus: approved\nsubmittedBy: claude\nreason: AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）\nsource: claude\n---\n\n# 用 Playwright 做真实后端 E2E\n\n## 要点\n\nmock 测不出登录态、数据库约束和清理顺序问题。\n\n- 只在设置 `E2E_API` 时跑真实栈，平时自动 skip。\n- 登录用 localStorage 注入，避免每个用例点一遍表单。\n- 测试数据用固定前缀，结束后 psql 清理，失败也清理。","02-Projects/release-2-4.md":"---\nformatVersion: 1\nkind: project\ntitle: northstar 发布 2.4.0：迁移与回滚\ntags: [release, migration, northstar, ops]\ncreated: 2026-10-19T07:45:39.479Z\nupdated: 2026-10-19T08:45:39.479Z\nstatus: approved\nsubmittedBy: deepseek-harness\nreason: AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）\nsource: deepseek-harness\n---\n\n# northstar 发布 2.4.0：迁移与回滚\n\n## 结果\n\n2.4.0 上线 0 停机，迁移耗时 38 秒，回滚脚本实测可用。\n\n- 迁移拆成“加列/回填/切换读/删旧列”四步，任何一步都能停。\n- 发布前在影子库跑一遍全量迁移。\n- 发布后 30 分钟观察错误率和慢查询，再放量。","03-Knowledge/pr-checklist.md":"---\nformatVersion: 1\nkind: knowledge\ntitle: PR 合并前必须核对的 7 件事\ntags: [review, checklist, git, northstar]\ncreated: 2026-10-18T19:45:39.479Z\nupdated: 2026-10-18T20:45:39.479Z\nstatus: approved\nsubmittedBy: codex\nreason: AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）\nsource: codex\n---\n\n# PR 合并前必须核对的 7 件事\n\n## 要点\n\n合并前固定核对：构建、单测、迁移、回滚、日志、权限、文档。\n\n- 任何一项没有输出就算没做。\n- 不合并“只差一个测试”的 PR，除非有明确的豁免记录。\n- 合并后立刻回灌镜像，避免主仓和部署副本漂移。","02-Projects/search-slow-query.md":"---\nformatVersion: 1\nkind: project\ntitle: northstar 搜索慢查询：tags 的反向索引\ntags: [search, sqlite, index, northstar]\ncreated: 2026-10-18T10:09:39.479Z\nupdated: 2026-10-18T11:09:39.479Z\nstatus: approved\nsubmittedBy: deepseek-harness\nreason: AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）\nsource: deepseek-harness\n---\n\n# northstar 搜索慢查询：tags 的反向索引\n\n## 根因\n\n标签筛选从 80ms 涨到 1.8s，根因是 `LIKE '%tag%'` 无法走索引。\n\n- 建 `card_tags(card_id, tag)` 反向表，按 tag 先查 card_id。\n- 多标签用交集，而不是 OR 后再过滤。\n- 用 `EXPLAIN QUERY PLAN` 守住“全表扫描”回归。","03-Knowledge/camera-events.md":"---\nformatVersion: 1\nkind: knowledge\ntitle: 相机 SDK 的异常事件回调\ntags: [camera, sdk, events, northstar]\ncreated: 2026-10-17T22:09:39.479Z\nupdated: 2026-10-17T23:09:39.479Z\nstatus: approved\nsubmittedBy: deepseek-harness\nreason: AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）\nsource: deepseek-harness\n---\n\n# 相机 SDK 的异常事件回调\n\n## 结论\n\n只靠取帧超时发现掉线，平均要 1.5 秒；打开 SDK 的异常事件回调后，拔线 200ms 内就能告警。\n\n- 回调里只做标记，重连交给状态机。\n- 回调可能重复触发，需要去抖。\n- 事件线程不要做 UI 操作，避免死锁。","02-Projects/mobile-single-column.md":"---\nformatVersion: 1\nkind: project\ntitle: northstar 移动端单列布局修复\ntags: [ui, mobile, layout, northstar]\ncreated: 2026-10-17T14:57:39.479Z\nupdated: 2026-10-17T15:57:39.479Z\nstatus: approved\nsubmittedBy: claude\nreason: AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）\nsource: claude\n---\n\n# northstar 移动端单列布局修复\n\n## 背景与结论\n\n390px 下侧栏常开、统计卡纵向堆叠，首屏看不到内容。改为底部 4 个 tab，统计压成一行数字。\n\n- 卡片单列，按钮最小 36px。\n- 结果行不再放键盘快捷键提示。\n- 用真实手机宽度跑截图验收，不靠桌面缩放。","05-Prompts/review-card-fields.md":"---\nformatVersion: 1\nkind: prompt\ntitle: 把 AI 的回答变成可审核卡的 3 个字段\ntags: [prompt, review, schema, northstar]\ncreated: 2026-10-17T00:33:39.479Z\nupdated: 2026-10-17T01:33:39.479Z\nstatus: approved\nsubmittedBy: claude\nreason: AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）\nsource: claude\n---\n\n# 把 AI 的回答变成可审核卡的 3 个字段\n\n## 核心改动\n\n只让模型输出 `decision`、`evidence`、`boundary` 三个字段，其他内容进原文。\n\n- 审核时先看 decision，再看 evidence 是否支撑。\n- boundary 必填，避免把一次实验当成通用结论。\n- 字段缺失直接判为不合格，不让模型自由发挥。","07-Tools/log-sampling.md":"---\nformatVersion: 1\nkind: tool\ntitle: northstar 日志分级与采样\ntags: [logs, observability, sampling, northstar]\ncreated: 2026-10-16T12:33:39.479Z\nupdated: 2026-10-16T13:33:39.479Z\nstatus: approved\nsubmittedBy: deepseek-harness\nreason: AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）\nsource: deepseek-harness\n---\n\n# northstar 日志分级与采样\n\n## 决策\n\n请求日志全量写会让磁盘一周涨 30GB；改为 error 全量、warn 10%、info 1%。\n\n- 采样键用 request id，保证同一条链路可追踪。\n- 关键业务事件不采样。\n- 日志保留 14 天，超期归档到冷存储。","04-Content/docs-navigation.md":"---\nformatVersion: 1\nkind: content\ntitle: northstar 文档站导航重构\ntags: [docs, navigation, content, northstar]\ncreated: 2026-10-15T19:45:39.479Z\nupdated: 2026-10-15T20:45:39.479Z\nstatus: approved\nsubmittedBy: claude\nreason: AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）\nsource: claude\n---\n\n# northstar 文档站导航重构\n\n## 背景与结论\n\n文档从 12 个一级入口收成 4 个：开始、指南、参考、更新。搜索放在顶部固定位置。\n\n- 新用户从首页到“跑起来”最多 3 次点击。\n- 每个页面加“最后更新”和“适用版本”。\n- 旧链接保留重定向，不制造 404。","02-Projects/auth-policy.md":"---\nformatVersion: 1\nkind: project\ntitle: northstar 权限模型：角色 vs 策略\ntags: [auth, rbac, security, northstar]\ncreated: 2026-10-14T14:57:39.479Z\nupdated: 2026-10-14T15:57:39.479Z\nstatus: approved\nsubmittedBy: deepseek-harness\nreason: AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）\nsource: deepseek-harness\n---\n\n# northstar 权限模型：角色 vs 策略\n\n## 决策\n\n不引入完整的 RBAC 表，先用“策略函数”表达权限：`can(user, action, resource)`。\n\n- 默认拒绝，所有放行都要有测试。\n- 角色只是策略的预设组合，不直接进数据库。\n- 等权限规则超过 20 条再考虑持久化。","03-Knowledge/pg-index-bloat.md":"---\nformatVersion: 1\nkind: knowledge\ntitle: Postgres 索引膨胀的排查路径\ntags: [postgres, index, performance, northstar]\ncreated: 2026-10-13T19:45:39.479Z\nupdated: 2026-10-13T20:45:39.479Z\nstatus: approved\nsubmittedBy: codex\nreason: AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）\nsource: codex\n---\n\n# Postgres 索引膨胀的排查路径\n\n## 根因\n\n写入放大后索引体积翻倍，查询反而变慢。根因是 autovacuum 跟不上，死元组留在索引里。\n\n- 先看 `pg_stat_user_tables` 的 dead tuple 和 last_autovacuum。\n- 对大表调低 autovacuum 阈值，分批 reindex。\n- 用 `pg_repack` 避免长时间锁表。","02-Projects/feature-flag.md":"---\nformatVersion: 1\nkind: project\ntitle: northstar 灰度发布开关设计\ntags: [release, feature-flag, risk, northstar]\ncreated: 2026-10-12T19:45:39.479Z\nupdated: 2026-10-12T20:45:39.479Z\nstatus: approved\nsubmittedBy: deepseek-harness\nreason: AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）\nsource: deepseek-harness\n---\n\n# northstar 灰度发布开关设计\n\n## 决策\n\n每个高风险功能必须有 kill switch，按用户/租户/百分比三档放量。\n\n- 开关状态变更写审计日志。\n- 默认关闭，发布后手动打开。\n- 开关过期时间强制填写，避免永久残留。","08-Mistakes/incident-delete.md":"---\nformatVersion: 1\nkind: mistake\ntitle: 一次误删生产数据的复盘\ntags: [incident, backup, postmortem, northstar]\ncreated: 2026-10-11T14:57:39.479Z\nupdated: 2026-10-11T15:57:39.479Z\nstatus: approved\nsubmittedBy: claude\nreason: AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）\nsource: claude\n---\n\n# 一次误删生产数据的复盘\n\n## 教训\n\n清理脚本少了一个 `WHERE`，删掉了 3 天的订单草稿。恢复花了 40 分钟。\n\n- 所有删除先软删，30 天后才物理清理。\n- 生产写操作默认 dry-run，必须显式加 `--apply`。\n- 备份恢复要定期演练，不能只验证备份文件存在。","02-Projects/architecture-monolith-first.md":"---\nformatVersion: 1\nkind: project\ntitle: northstar 早期架构：单体优先\ntags: [architecture, northstar, sqlite]\ncreated: 2026-09-08T19:45:39.479Z\nupdated: 2026-09-08T20:45:39.479Z\nstatus: approved\nsubmittedBy: deepseek-harness\nreason: AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）\nsource: deepseek-harness\n---\n\n# northstar 早期架构：单体优先\n\n## 结论\n\n第一版坚持单体 + SQLite：没有消息队列、没有微服务、没有 Redis。\n\n- 部署就是一个二进制 + 一个数据文件。\n- 所有模块先在同一进程内调用，边界用接口约束。\n- 等真的出现独立扩缩容需求，再拆。","03-Knowledge/search-simple-first.md":"---\nformatVersion: 1\nkind: knowledge\ntitle: 为什么先把搜索做简单\ntags: [search, sqlite, northstar]\ncreated: 2026-09-02T19:45:39.479Z\nupdated: 2026-09-02T20:45:39.479Z\nstatus: approved\nsubmittedBy: claude\nreason: AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）\nsource: claude\n---\n\n# 为什么先把搜索做简单\n\n## 结论\n\n没有上向量库：先用 SQLite FTS + 标签过滤，把“能找到”做好。\n\n- 结构化标签的召回质量比 embedding 更可控。\n- 结果可解释：为什么命中、命中了哪些词。\n- 等用户量证明需要语义检索，再引入向量。","08-Mistakes/review-first-pitfalls.md":"---\nformatVersion: 1\nkind: mistake\ntitle: 第一版审核流的三个坑\ntags: [review, workflow, northstar]\ncreated: 2026-08-27T19:45:39.479Z\nupdated: 2026-08-27T20:45:39.479Z\nstatus: approved\nsubmittedBy: deepseek-harness\nreason: AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）\nsource: deepseek-harness\n---\n\n# 第一版审核流的三个坑\n\n## 教训\n\n第一版审核只能看标题，用户被迫盲批；批量批准没有撤销；队列没有排序。\n\n- 审核必须能读正文。\n- 所有批量操作必须可撤销。\n- 默认按时间倒序，别让用户猜。","07-Tools/backup-local-first.md":"---\nformatVersion: 1\nkind: tool\ntitle: 本地优先的备份策略\ntags: [backup, local-first, sqlite]\ncreated: 2026-08-20T19:45:39.479Z\nupdated: 2026-08-20T20:45:39.479Z\nstatus: approved\nsubmittedBy: deepseek-harness\nreason: AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）\nsource: deepseek-harness\n---\n\n# 本地优先的备份策略\n\n## 要点\n\n每天自动备份，保留 7 天；备份文件带时间戳，恢复前先校验。\n\n- 备份和主库不在同一个磁盘。\n- 恢复流程写成脚本，不靠记忆。\n- 每周抽查一次恢复。","04-Content/logs-as-product.md":"---\nformatVersion: 1\nkind: content\ntitle: 把日志当产品来设计\ntags: [logs, product, northstar]\ncreated: 2026-08-13T19:45:39.479Z\nupdated: 2026-08-13T20:45:39.479Z\nstatus: approved\nsubmittedBy: claude\nreason: AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）\nsource: claude\n---\n\n# 把日志当产品来设计\n\n## 要点\n\n日志不是调试残留，是用户理解系统的界面。\n\n- 一条日志回答：发生了什么、影响谁、下一步做什么。\n- 错误日志必须带 request id。\n- 不要打印完整 token 或用户隐私。","02-Projects/v1-retro.md":"---\nformatVersion: 1\nkind: project\ntitle: v1 发布复盘：哪些决定还成立\ntags: [release, retro, northstar]\ncreated: 2026-07-28T19:45:39.479Z\nupdated: 2026-07-28T20:45:39.479Z\nstatus: approved\nsubmittedBy: deepseek-harness\nreason: AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）\nsource: deepseek-harness\n---\n\n# v1 发布复盘：哪些决定还成立\n\n## 结论\n\nv1 发布 3 个月后回看：单体、SQLite、审核优先、Markdown 可导出，四个决定仍然成立。\n\n- 不成立的是“先不做搜索”，用户第一周就在找东西。\n- 下一个版本优先补可解释召回。\n- 不要把“以后再说”当成决定。","02-Projects/explainable-recall.md":"---\nformatVersion: 1\nkind: project\ntitle: northstar 2.5 计划：把召回做成可解释的\ntags: [northstar, recall, explainability]\ncreated: 2026-10-24T17:21:39.479Z\nupdated: 2026-10-24T18:21:39.479Z\nstatus: pending\nsubmittedBy: deepseek-harness\nreason: AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）\nsource: deepseek-harness\n---\n\n# northstar 2.5 计划：把召回做成可解释的\n\n## 背景与结论\n\n用户反馈“不知道为什么召回这张卡”。2.5 给每次召回加三个字段：命中词、共享标签、最后使用时间。\n\n- 召回结果旁显示“为什么是它”。\n- 支持用户点“不相关”，作为下一轮排序信号。\n- 不引入黑盒向量分数，先做可解释的规则。","03-Knowledge/camera-sdk-2-4.md":"---\nformatVersion: 1\nkind: knowledge\ntitle: 相机 SDK 升级 2.4 的兼容性清单\ntags: [camera, sdk, compatibility]\ncreated: 2026-10-24T14:57:39.479Z\nupdated: 2026-10-24T15:57:39.479Z\nstatus: pending\nsubmittedBy: codex\nreason: AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）\nsource: codex\n---\n\n# 相机 SDK 升级 2.4 的兼容性清单\n\n## 要点\n\nSDK 2.4 改了事件回调线程模型，升级前核对：回调线程、句柄释放顺序、异常码映射。\n\n- 先在离线环境跑 24 小时拔插测试。\n- 旧固件保留回滚包。\n- 不要在线程回调里直接操作 UI。","02-Projects/keyboard-audit.md":"---\nformatVersion: 1\nkind: project\ntitle: 把审核中心做成键盘优先\ntags: [review, keyboard, ux]\ncreated: 2026-10-24T12:33:39.479Z\nupdated: 2026-10-24T13:33:39.479Z\nstatus: pending\nsubmittedBy: claude\nreason: AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）\nsource: claude\n---\n\n# 把审核中心做成键盘优先\n\n## 决策\n\n审核是高频动作，鼠标逐行点太低效。默认支持 J/K 切换、A 批准、R 驳回。\n\n- 焦点始终可见。\n- 批量操作保留确认与撤销。\n- 快捷键在界面上可发现，不靠记忆。","03-Knowledge/sqlite-cjk-search.md":"---\nformatVersion: 1\nkind: knowledge\ntitle: SQLite 全文检索中文分词方案\ntags: [sqlite, cjk, search]\ncreated: 2026-10-24T10:09:39.479Z\nupdated: 2026-10-24T11:09:39.479Z\nstatus: pending\nsubmittedBy: deepseek-harness\nreason: AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）\nsource: deepseek-harness\n---\n\n# SQLite 全文检索中文分词方案\n\n## 根因\n\nSQLite FTS5 默认分词对中文不友好，整句被当成一个 token。\n\n- 方案 A：写入时按 2-gram 切分，召回高但索引大。\n- 方案 B：外部分词后存 token 列，查询走 LIKE 前缀。\n- 先测召回和体积，再选。","04-Content/release-notes-template.md":"---\nformatVersion: 1\nkind: content\ntitle: 发布说明模板 v2\ntags: [release, notes, template]\ncreated: 2026-10-24T07:45:39.479Z\nupdated: 2026-10-24T08:45:39.479Z\nstatus: pending\nsubmittedBy: claude\nreason: AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）\nsource: claude\n---\n\n# 发布说明模板 v2\n\n## 要点\n\n发布说明固定四段：一句话结论、用户可感知变化、升级注意、回滚方式。\n\n- 不贴提交列表。\n- 每个变化都写“对用户意味着什么”。\n- 附上升级命令。","04-Content/user-note-raw.md":"---\nformatVersion: 1\nkind: content\ntitle: 用户：把这个记一下\ntags: [raw]\ncreated: 2026-10-15T19:45:39.479Z\nupdated: 2026-10-15T20:45:39.479Z\nstatus: rejected\nsubmittedBy: claude\nreason: AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）\nsource: claude\n---\n\n# 用户：把这个记一下\n\n## 摘要\n\n用户：把这个记一下。","04-Content/temp-test-card.md":"---\nformatVersion: 1\nkind: content\ntitle: 临时测试卡\ntags: [raw]\ncreated: 2026-10-10T19:45:39.479Z\nupdated: 2026-10-10T20:45:39.479Z\nstatus: rejected\nsubmittedBy: codex\nreason: AI 自动沉淀（蒸馏卡）\nsource: codex\n---\n\n# 临时测试卡\n\n## 摘要\n\n测试自动沉淀。"},"activity":[{"ts":1792874559479,"action":"created","text":"新卡：northstar API 分页从 offset 改为 cursor（待审核）","preview":"","session":"demo","model":"deepseek-flash"},{"ts":1792874319479,"action":"listen","text":"会话事件 18 条 → 有效对话 1,642 字","preview":"用户：把这次决策记下来，下次开会要用。","session":"demo","model":"deepseek-flash"},{"ts":1792873479479,"action":"created","text":"新卡：northstar 缓存层选型：SQLite WAL 而不是 Redis（待审核）","preview":"","session":"demo","model":"deepseek-flash"},{"ts":1792873239479,"action":"listen","text":"会话事件 18 条 → 有效对话 1,642 字","preview":"用户：把这次决策记下来，下次开会要用。","session":"demo","model":"deepseek-flash"},{"ts":1792872399479,"action":"created","text":"新卡：部署流水线从 GitHub Actions 迁到本地门禁（待审核）","preview":"","session":"demo","model":"deepseek-flash"},{"ts":1792872159479,"action":"listen","text":"会话事件 18 条 → 有效对话 1,642 字","preview":"用户：把这次决策记下来，下次开会要用。","session":"demo","model":"deepseek-flash"},{"ts":1792871319479,"action":"created","text":"新卡：相机采集丢帧根因：开流顺序导致 ROI 静默失效（待审核）","preview":"","session":"demo","model":"deepseek-flash"},{"ts":1792871079479,"action":"listen","text":"会话事件 18 条 → 有效对话 1,642 字","preview":"用户：把这次决策记下来，下次开会要用。","session":"demo","model":"deepseek-flash"},{"ts":1792870239479,"action":"created","text":"新卡：Rust 兼容上游新增字段：用 ..Default::default() 而非硬写字段（待审核）","preview":"","session":"demo","model":"deepseek-flash"},{"ts":1792869999479,"action":"listen","text":"会话事件 18 条 → 有效对话 1,642 字","preview":"用户：把这次决策记下来，下次开会要用。","session":"demo","model":"deepseek-flash"},{"ts":1792869159479,"action":"created","text":"新卡：MCP 工具描述要写成可执行契约（待审核）","preview":"","session":"demo","model":"deepseek-flash"},{"ts":1792868919479,"action":"listen","text":"会话事件 18 条 → 有效对话 1,642 字","preview":"用户：把这次决策记下来，下次开会要用。","session":"demo","model":"deepseek-flash"},{"ts":1792868079479,"action":"created","text":"新卡：把长会话蒸馏成卡的提示词模板（待审核）","preview":"","session":"demo","model":"deepseek-flash"},{"ts":1792867839479,"action":"listen","text":"会话事件 18 条 → 有效对话 1,642 字","preview":"用户：把这次决策记下来，下次开会要用。","session":"demo","model":"deepseek-flash"},{"ts":1792866999479,"action":"created","text":"新卡：UI 连发多版引发回归的三条纪律（待审核）","preview":"","session":"demo","model":"deepseek-flash"},{"ts":1792866759479,"action":"listen","text":"会话事件 18 条 → 有效对话 1,642 字","preview":"用户：把这次决策记下来，下次开会要用。","session":"demo","model":"deepseek-flash"},{"ts":1792820739479,"action":"boot","text":"面板一键重启常驻实例成功：端口 7999 正在服务 v0.11.0-rc.1","preview":"","session":"system"},{"ts":1792802739479,"action":"skip","text":"冷却中：距上次沉淀 120s < 300s","preview":"","session":"demo"}],"health":{"ok":true,"reason":"","since":0,"lastOkAt":1792874619479,"lastFailAt":0},"ledger":{"days":7,"recalls":46,"recallChars":28400,"captures":14,"captureInChars":41200,"captureOutChars":9800,"estTokens":39700,"feedback":{"useful":19,"useless":5,"rate":0.7916666666666666}}};
